<title>AUSTRALIA: Rugby Union-Australia name side for tour match.</title>
<headline>Rugby Union-Australia name side for tour match.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-11-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australia have announced their side to face Combined Scottish Districts in Glasgow on Saturday.</p>
<p>The team is:</p>
<p>15-Joe Roff; 14-Ben Tune, 13-Daniel Herbert, 12-Pat Howard, 11-David Campese; 10-David Knox, 9-George Gregan: 8-Mark Connors, 7-David Wilson (captain), 6-Daniel Manu, 5-John Welborn, 4-David Giffin, 3-Andrew Blades, 2-Michael Foley, 1-Richard Harry.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373 1800</p>
</text>
